1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,720
Nine out of ten deaf babies are born to
hearing parents.

2
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,410
Overnight, those parents need a new
language.

3
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:13,896
But learning from a video is hard.

4
00:00:13,976 --> 00:00:18,430
The signer faces you, so you flip every
movement in your head.

5
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:21,720
And nobody tells you if your hands are
right.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,184
So I built Signsprout.

7
00:00:24,264 --> 00:00:28,124
It opens from a link in the Quest browser.

8
00:00:28,204 --> 00:00:32,720
You stay seated, and all you need are your
hands.

9
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,989
No wall of text.

10
00:00:35,069 --> 00:00:43,165
Hold up your hands, pick the hand you
write with, and touch your chin,

11
00:00:43,245 --> 00:00:47,720
so every sign lands in the right place.

12
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,616
Every sign has four steps.

13
00:00:50,696 --> 00:00:51,864
First, watch.

14
00:00:51,944 --> 00:00:57,720
Sprout shows it face to face, mirrored, so
it's easy to copy.

15
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:02,653
Then glowing guide hands appear right
where your hands are.

16
00:01:02,733 --> 00:01:05,880
Put your hands inside them and sign along.

17
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:11,720
Signsprout reads twenty-five joints on
each hand, and tells you what to fix.

18
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,900
Now it's your turn, from memory.

19
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:22,869
It checks the handshape, then the place,
then the movement.

20
00:01:22,949 --> 00:01:29,720
And for signs at your face, a mirror shows
you your hands.

21
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:39,720
Get it right, and a new plant sprouts in
your garden.

22
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,913
Your garden is your progress.

23
00:01:42,993 --> 00:01:47,535
Plants grow as signs move into long-term
memory,

24
00:01:47,615 --> 00:01:51,772
and droop a little when it's time to
review.

25
00:01:51,852 --> 00:01:55,720
Five minutes a day fits before bath time.

26
00:01:56,200 --> 00:02:02,951
On your phone, tell Sprout what you need,
like words for bath time.

27
00:02:03,031 --> 00:02:08,151
The AI coach plans from signs Signsprout
can check,

28
00:02:08,231 --> 00:02:11,720
and the plan waits in your headset.

29
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,607
Left-handed?

30
00:02:13,687 --> 00:02:15,714
Every sign flips.

31
00:02:15,794 --> 00:02:23,399
There's a limited finger range, high
contrast and calm motion,

32
00:02:23,479 --> 00:02:29,720
and you can press any button just by
looking at it.

33
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,587
Signsprout.

34
00:02:45,667 --> 00:02:51,720
Your first ASL signs, with your own two
hands.
